{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tokachi Detective: The Balloon Case",
    "steam_appid": 3008470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a balloon ride and use your sycophancy. That's all I had to do, and I should be fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was naive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich man was erased. Why? No, more importantly, who killed him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokachi, you wouldn't have a problem with that, would you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your memories are reset every week, and you always return to being 18 years old. As detective &quot;tokachi,&quot; you descend upon the mysterious remote island of Soraga Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a new type of chat/sound novel that progresses through dense text and dialogue in the style of amagi hazime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the eyes of tokachi, players will relive the events that take place on the island and at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge of a 2-hour, cinematic mystery while enjoying the music that was commissioned and prepared specifically for this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 2-3 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer Mode Available: If you plan to stream the game, please activate Streamer Mode by clicking the button in the bottom-right corner of the menu screen (it will display a red frame when successfully enabled). When Streamer Mode is on, the story progression will be interrupted at certain points to prevent spoilers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a balloon ride and use your sycophancy. That's all I had to do, and I should be fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was naive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich man was erased. Why? No, more importantly, who killed him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokachi, you wouldn't have a problem with that, would you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your memories are reset every week, and you always return to being 18 years old. As detective &quot;tokachi,&quot; you descend upon the mysterious remote island of Soraga Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a new type of chat/sound novel that progresses through dense text and dialogue in the style of amagi hazime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the eyes of tokachi, players will relive the events that take place on the island and at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge of a 2-hour, cinematic mystery while enjoying the music that was commissioned and prepared specifically for this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 2-3 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer Mode Available: If you plan to stream the game, please activate Streamer Mode by clicking the button in the bottom-right corner of the menu screen (it will display a red frame when successfully enabled). When Streamer Mode is on, the story progression will be interrupted at certain points to prevent spoilers.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In the far south of Tokyo, the Ogasawara Islands. A wealthy individual ascended to high altitudes in a hot air balloon and died from lack of oxygen. At first, she thought it was an accident. There were suspicious elements, however.",
